================================================================================
Pi (packages/mcp)
https://github.com/earendil-works/pi
Release v1.3.0, revision 71023aec1546d6d677a65669c5665c0927ce0dd0.
Ported: the JSON-RPC message shapes and checks of src/protocol/jsonrpc.ts, the
protocol versions and initialize, tool, and tool-result shapes of
src/protocol/types.ts and src/protocol/content.ts, the request correlation,
initialization, tool listing and calling, cancellation, and close behavior of
src/client.ts, the transport contract of src/transports/transport.ts, and the
newline-delimited framing of src/transports/stdio.ts, with cases of
test/client.test.ts and test/stdio.test.ts.
Not ported: the OAuth client (src/oauth/, adapted by Pi from the MIT-licensed
Model Context Protocol TypeScript SDK, whose notice Pi keeps under
packages/mcp/LICENSES/), the Streamable HTTP transport, the stdio process
spawning and shutdown, resources, progress, and roots.
